Facts from other works
----------------------

Shelly's API documentation (shelly-api-docs.shelly.cloud: the Gen1 HTTP
API, CoIoT and MQTT; the Gen2+ RPC API, its components, authentication,
the WebSocket and MQTT channels, the outbound WebSocket, BLE RPC). IETF
RFC 7252 (CoAP framing) and RFC 7616 (HTTP digest with SHA-256). Facts
only; no documentation text is reproduced.

